---
// The pause button of a home page demo window; <rc-demo> shows it when the demo plays by itself.
---

<button type="button" class="rc-window-pause" data-demo-pause aria-label="Pause the demo" aria-pressed="false" hidden>
  <svg class="rc-icon-pause" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2h3v12H4zM9 2h3v12H9z"></path></svg>
  <svg class="rc-icon-play" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2l10 6-10 6z"></path></svg>
</button>
